      "findingId": "reentrancy-eth-transfer",
      "title": "ETH 提取函数存在重入漏洞",
      "severity": "critical",
      "description": "withdraw 函数在通过低级 call 向调用者发送 ETH 后，才更新用户的余额记录。攻击者合约可在接收 ETH 的 fallback/receive 函数中再次调用 withdraw，此时 balances[msg.sender] 尚未扣减，导致同一笔余额被反复提取，最终耗尽合约中的全部资金。",
      "evidence": {
        "file": "Contract.sol",
        "lines": "15-21",
        "snippet": "function withdraw(uint256 amount) external {\n    require(tx.origin == owner, \"not owner\");\n    require(balances[msg.sender] >= amount, \"insufficient\");\n    (bool ok, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}(\"\");\n    require(ok, \"transfer failed\");\n    balances[msg.sender] -= amount;\n}"
      },
      "exploitScenario": "1. 攻击者部署恶意合约并向 Vault 存入少量 ETH（如 1 ETH）。2. 攻击者通过钓鱼链接诱使 owner 与恶意合约交互，满足 tx.origin == owner 的条件。3. 恶意合约调用 vault.withdraw(1 ether)。4. Vault 向恶意合约发送 1 ETH，触发其 receive 函数。5. receive 函数再次调用 vault.withdraw(1 ether)，由于 balances[恶意合约] 仍未更新，检查通过。6. 循环重入直至 Vault 的 ETH 余额被完全耗尽。",
      "recommendation": "采用 Checks-Effects-Interactions 模式：先更新余额 balances[msg.sender] -= amount，再执行外部 ETH 转账。同时建议添加重入锁（nonReentrant modifier）以增强安全性。",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "findingId": "tx-origin-authentication",
      "title": "使用 tx.origin 进行权限校验",
      "severity": "high",
      "description": "withdraw 函数使用 tx.origin == owner 进行身份验证，而非安全的 msg.sender。这意味着任何中间合约只要是在 owner 发起的交易调用链中，即可通过权限检查并调用敏感函数，极大增加了钓鱼攻击的风险。",
      "evidence": {
        "file": "Contract.sol",
        "lines": "16",
        "snippet": "require(tx.origin == owner, \"not owner\");"
      },
      "exploitScenario": "攻击者部署恶意合约并通过钓鱼手段（如假冒空投网站）诱使 owner 向其合约发起交易。由于 tx.origin 仍为 owner 地址，恶意合约可以调用 VulnerableVault.withdraw 并通过权限校验，再结合重入漏洞将 Vault 资金全部盗走。",
      "recommendation": "立即将 tx.origin 替换为 msg.sender 进行访问控制，即 require(msg.sender == owner, \"not owner\")。",
      "confidence": 0.9
    }
