      "recommendation": "Avoid arbitrary `delegatecall` to untrusted targets. If upgradeability is required, use a well-audited proxy pattern (e.g., EIP-1967 transparent proxy) with a fixed implementation address and proper access controls. Otherwise, remove this function entirely.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ]
}

